## Data Cleaning Steps

### Raw data issues found

| Issue | Count | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Exact duplicate rows (same title + release date) | 304 | Removed |
| Missing `year` / `release_date` | 14 | Dropped |
| Zero-vote / zero-rating rows | ~140 | Kept but flagged as unreliable |
| Same-name films with different release dates | 384 titles | **Kept** — treated as distinct films |

> Deduplication was done on `(title, release_date)` — not just title — to avoid removing legitimate films that share a name (e.g. two versions of *War of the Worlds*).

